        <div class="modal-dialog">

            <!-- Modal content-->
            <div class="modal-content">

                <div class="modal-body">
                    <h4>Work flow for Promoter</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:10px;">Once the client submitted his feedback score, immediately the system check if the score is between 9 to 10, then the survey is tagged as Promoter. Based on its deal size, the system allocates closed-loop analysis to the respective HOD/MD.</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:10px;">On the 1st of the following month, the Promoter email will be sent to HOD/MD with a separate email to the Global Admin.</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:10px;">For 3 continuous days, the system sends a reminder email to the respective HOD/MD if no action on closed-loop analysis.</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:10px;">On the 8th of every month, a final reminder email is send to the HOD/MD and CC’ed to COO for non-compliance.</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-default" data-dismiss="modal" id="btnConfirmDelete1">Close</button>
                    <input type="hidden" value="" id="hdfDeletedRecordID" />
