                        <li style="margin-bottom:10px;">For 3 continuous days, the system sends a reminder email to the respective HOD/MD, if no action on closed-loop analysis.</li>
                        <li style="margin-bottom:10px;">On the 8th day, a final reminder email is send to the HOD/MD and CC’ed to COO for non-compliance.</li>
